WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.792
I moved here around 2007–2008, and it
was the forest that drew me, really.

2
00:00:09.842 --> 00:00:12.950
It's the only proper forest in the city.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.181
I moved to Greenfield precisely
because the forest was right next door.

4
00:00:20.231 --> 00:00:23.950
That was one of the deciding factors.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.007
I started running in the
forest, getting some exercise.

6
00:00:29.057 --> 00:00:31.950
At first it was a bit of a mess.

7
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.950
It was full of rubbish and neglected, but over
the years I've seen that it can look good.

8
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.950
These days, if you ask
me, it looks pretty good.

9
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.950
This park was popular even
before it was renovated,

10
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.122
because it's out in nature, in the open air.

11
00:00:53.172 --> 00:00:59.950
The zoo end was probably far too
crowded, so people preferred this spot.

12
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:07.950
But the forest is much more than
this spot, and loads of people

13
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:15.950
use it. I see the same faces, I know them by now,
we've known each other for ages. And I'm sure

14
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:21.150
they help look after it too, and
not just by not dropping litter.

15
00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:23.950
Lots of people actually pick it up.

16
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:32.950
Of course, it could be better: a few more
bins, some collection points would be welcome.

17
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:38.950
And we need to make sure we keep it this way, keep
it for ourselves, for the people of Bucharest.

